  "description": "Image-codec facade over the SharpAstro codec family: sniff a byte stream's format by its magic-byte signature and dispatch to the matching decoder (PNG, JPEG, TIFF, JPEG XR, OpenEXR, JPEG XL, JBIG2, JPEG 2000, WebP, Netpbm PBM/PGM/PPM/PAM, and TGA by its TGA 2.0 footer, since a TGA has no leading magic number), returning a codec-neutral IDecodedImage (fidelity tier: native bit depth + ColorEncoding colour signalling, with a ToFloats() RGBA float32 view) or decoding zero-copy into a caller-provided 8-bit RGBA buffer (display tier, integer-sample formats). AOT-compatible.",
